        <mxCell id="erd_legend" value="&lt;b style='font-size:13px;color:#0F172A;'&gt;ERD NOTATION, CARDINALITY &amp;amp; CLOUD FIRESTORE STORAGE LEGEND&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;1. Crow's Foot Cardinality Symbols (IE Standard):&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Mandatory One (1..1):&lt;/b&gt; Double vertical bar — Exactly one parent/target record must exist&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Optional One (0..1):&lt;/b&gt; Circle + vertical bar — Zero or at most one linked record&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Mandatory Many (1..*):&lt;/b&gt; Vertical bar + Crow's foot — One or more child records required&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Optional Many (0..*):&lt;/b&gt; Circle + Crow's foot — Zero, one, or many child documents in subcollection&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;2. Key Badges &amp;amp; Color Coding:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b style='color:#B91C1C;'&gt;[PK]&lt;/b&gt; Primary Key (Firestore Document ID) &amp;nbsp;|&amp;nbsp; &lt;b style='color:#1D4ED8;'&gt;[FK]&lt;/b&gt; Foreign Key Reference &amp;nbsp;|&amp;nbsp; &lt;b style='color:#7C2D12;'&gt;[PFK / EMB]&lt;/b&gt; Embedded Composite Key / Map&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b style='color:#1E3A8A;'&gt;Blue Header:&lt;/b&gt; Root Collections (&lt;code&gt;/users&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;/teams&lt;/code&gt;)&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b style='color:#065F46;'&gt;Green Header:&lt;/b&gt; Team Subcollections (&lt;code&gt;/services&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;/songs&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;/substitutions&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;/announcements&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;/messages&lt;/code&gt;)&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b style='color:#7C2D12;'&gt;Orange/Purple Header:&lt;/b&gt; Embedded Sub-Documents &amp;amp; &lt;code&gt;/password_resets&lt;/code&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b style='color:#0F766E;'&gt;Teal Header:&lt;/b&gt; Planned Final Build Extensions (&lt;code&gt;/notifications&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;fcmToken&lt;/code&gt;, Duty Status, Song PDF/MP3)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeColor=#334155;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=11.5;fontColor=#1E293B;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingTop=12;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1780" y="1265" width="1020" height="560" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>
      </root>
